meta {
  name: List all evaluations
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/capacity-building?page=&limit=&search=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 
  limit: 
  search: 
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # List All Capacity Building Evaluations

  Returns a paginated list of capacity building programme evaluation submissions. Results are ordered by creation date in ascending order. Supports full-text search via PostgreSQL GIN index.

  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default | Description / Allowed Values                                                                            |
  |-----------|--------|----------|---------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`     | Page number (integer ≥ 1)                                                                               |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`    | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                                                                         |
  | search    | string | No       | —       | Full-text search query. When provided, cache is bypassed and results are matched against the GIN index. |

  ### Searchable Fields

  | Field                | Weight |
  |----------------------|--------|
  | `programName`        | A      |
  | `programType`        | A      |
  | `location`           | A      |
  | `programCoordinator` | A      |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of capacity building evaluation records.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [ ... ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25, 
        "totalPages": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```

  Results are cached under the key `cedarrise:capacity:evaluation:{page}:{limit}` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters.                             |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.              |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `read` permission.           |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                              |
}
